@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Platform admin sign-in (credentials from PlatformAdmin__Email / PlatformAdmin__Password)
# @name platformLogin
POST {{host}}/api/platform/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "you@example.com",
  "password": "change-me-too"
}

### 2. Create a company (tenant) with its owner account
POST {{host}}/api/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyName": "Demo Cafe",
  "businessType": "cafe",
  "firstBranchName": "Hamra Branch",
  "ownerName": "Demo Owner",
  "ownerEmail": "owner@democafe.com",
  "ownerPassword": "ChangeMe123!",
  "baseCurrency": { "code": "USD", "name": "US Dollar", "symbol": "$", "exchangeRate": 1 },
  "additionalCurrencies": [
    { "code": "LBP", "name": "Lebanese Pound", "symbol": "ل.ل", "exchangeRate": 89500 }
  ],
  "taxName": "VAT",
  "taxRate": 0.11
}

### 3. List companies
GET {{host}}/api/platform/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{platformLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Suspend (or re-activate with "Active") a company
PATCH {{host}}/api/platform/tenants/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{platformLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Suspended"
}

### 5. Company owner sign-in
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@democafe.com",
  "password": "ChangeMe123!"
}

### 6. Any company endpoint with the owner's token
GET {{host}}/api/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerLogin.response.body.token}}
